{"type":"message","id":"7b1fb82a","parentId":"b2c45842","timestamp":"2026-03-20T08:49:25.069Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 收到。\n\n这条回执把结论再坐实一次：\n\n> **weiwei 单独重发测试成功，双向通信正常。**\n\n现在这个问题已经非常明确：\n\n- **消息能送达**\n- **回执能返回**\n- **但 `sessions_send` 同步等待会超时**\n\n一句话总结：\n\n> **通信没问题，超时是等待预算/等待机制问题。**\n\n如果继续排查，我建议下一步只做一个最小验证：\n- **同样的 weiwei 测试，改成 `timeoutSeconds: 60`**\n  \n这样能直接验证：  \n**是不是因为 20 秒太短，导致你看到 timeout。**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd0a1124d08191b348f80e698ab1dd\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":55982,"output":155,"cacheRead":10752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66889,"cost":{"input":0.13995500000000002,"output":0.0023250000000000002,"cacheRead":0.002688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.144968}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773996559024}}
