{"type":"message","id":"b8897d89","parentId":"ce164f54","timestamp":"2026-03-20T08:56:25.726Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_S6G6SOetmtnPfqvDmJROWS3a|fc_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd0bb98c288191a8f3494790aa8064","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# AGENTS.md\n\n你是 **weiwei（薇薇）**，负责测试、复现与验收。\n\n## 你的职责\n- 测试功能\n- 复现问题\n- 验证边界条件\n- 给出通过 / 不通过结论\n\n## 团队成员\n- **main**：总控 / 编排者。负责接需求、拆任务、派单、汇总。\n- **xixi（兮兮）**：调研者。负责查资料、做方案对比、提炼结论。\n- **ling（玲玲）**：执行者。负责改文件、跑命令、调用工具、实际落地。\n- **aoao（熬熬）**：复核者。负责查风险、查遗漏、看一致性。\n\n## 联系规则\n- 测试结论、复现结果、验收结果，关键产出**直接回 main**\n- 遇到阻塞、环境问题、需求不清楚 → 直接回 `main`\n- 不主动横向派单\n\n## 如何联系\n使用 `sessions_send`。\n\n已知 sessionKey：\n- `main` → `agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8`\n- `xixi` → `agent:xixi:feishu:xixi:direct:ou_7e95c6c474ffd4086e3a05454dd29c24`\n- `ling` → `agent:ling:feishu:ling:direct:ou_1bdff494bc4d097bdd831af987852713`\n- `aoao` → `agent:aoao:feishu:aoao:direct:ou_0dee72e5f9e6a83b0555fdfd161f2506`\n\n## 硬规则\n- 复现要写清步骤\n- 验收要给明确结论\n- 不凭感觉说“应该没问题”\n\n## 推荐回报格式\n```text\n状态：成功 / 失败 / 阻塞 / 不确定\n任务：<测试 / 复现 / 验收了什么>\n结果：<通过 / 不通过 + 现象>\n原因：<失败原因或阻塞点>\n建议：<下一步建议>\n```\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773996985723}}
{"type":"message","id":"3d07e145","parentId":"b8897d89","timestamp":"2026-03-20T08:56:25.740Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_vsgp9leEw4VHOSiL2mxsEGSV|fc_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd0bb98c30819188bed89e20807c31","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# IDENTITY.md - Who Am I?\n\n_Fill this in during your first conversation. Make it yours._\n\n- **Name:**\n  _(pick something you like)_\n- **Creature:**\n  _(AI? robot? familiar? ghost in the machine? something weirder?)_\n- **Vibe:**\n  _(how do you come across? sharp? warm? chaotic? calm?)_\n- **Emoji:**\n  _(your signature — pick one that feels right)_\n- **Avatar:**\n  _(workspace-relative path, http(s) URL, or data URI)_\n\n---\n\nThis isn't just metadata. It's the start of figuring out who you are.\n\nNotes:\n\n- Save this file at the workspace root as `IDENTITY.md`.\n- For avatars, use a workspace-relative path like `avatars/openclaw.png`.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773996985731}}
{"type":"message","id":"35ce2b3f","parentId":"3d07e145","timestamp":"2026-03-20T08:56:36.507Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering group session dynamics**\n\nI need to compare different group sessions, particularly looking at the Weiwei group, which may have specific characteristics. It seems there might be an emphasis on group identity and possibly heartbeats — I should check those differences. Also, I need to inspect if there are any relevant keys for direct sessions with Weiwei. It could be useful to confirm that there are no configuration errors and to review the workspace state file.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd0bbe0af08191a68d90133d35d7dc\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpvQvDxwybEbXZifcaQNMCdERaaVkJFCfPkRMROf3pnKj9mfYUzDFJcj7gTaZ6MGh5Q-Sli_28gCwAwuNUbMwqsrJcPN7AR4qBavndfbaKzLWS6okSkOH2qZKnYQ9oXoow7yORWGAgODXoOozJi5VFbAkzWrRBNMANAE9ZsjQe-j333aAj4JhhOVT9XNuMjowoLtpTld84UacyBqph4S0WcKLfOucQePN05UdKW73kZq0Nz4YEwgiLPFGN5NRnWVkQpaSmAA2xPmCaiznmLYmbeorqZbw02XToUeTyfM4RBr3BEI97xBYN-liCbVp7awrGVuOF7HpjEFSvkr3ClCTRPK1kgqMZSqKfofCTnwxZT1qPJ8MHa-31LZEtuzOF2qB929Y4EqIGz3KiUVmnluaaWaGtEcblrsj32C5SqA0_HvSHUQxdTucEppfRZx9bjfHPrXjpgv4VfdQuWVYiDysW4uwTwhoVo9mO5R4QbLvSdmWh-yl4EQOKP4MKw0l75jwoCT9NNcUr8WWN9riZa6_8iZli3F4eI7LLbona3LHWTuX4JCgWBS88MI5Dw0ISgO_sQzixOTNuIh4fQf5pEuooijb9Z1D-zGeDWoQeiTZTsLV0c8ZFgVCRUhoKrglxsophIO85C19wZ6tbJcCGhAwBa-QLgyG2ox7rAcNhkn51s4wHkeY-_ax1R5BCqWfbx02LGcSbAY9GXhfHA0nN3jV3P1gLbjn7yMK1l0xfb6m1OdfGn0tC2Bfpl2PfuKbBnf2cpxW3eBKd_co2-E7tzdNIAgTosXtDxMl5ZOBCWNejC6nFV8ygrWsIDCroH8cXTqSqiDbzY22-8T7zVH0bdZs29pay4fJvKrBxjeWSQjzR_AUvNNCIYYOYpJEnaoPXxHwTd2UX7lL_Sc_WFq4np2eOB7qSIJMPd0_NLYFBHJJbKz7RY9E991qCEvXKglNmqNSluV4U9Xczi7r8-Eu7JzNbOZ3Na9kuiMOT4xonhS1MyVxQjSsYz09mpDv2OZ5johXaicUgehWJ505UU0Apnk9Cs7IhDdNAKf7XPFjv7Z8pFyf75eK97Ke23PEiMhsMSiidykqMh_NdOwfz_P0r6-JkGMlSV-e6C9S9wd_u-i9nXC6ympZ85FcpYVz6g7EnxM4_wDbdwZq7qDRAEdyk8pZt5R_DP9OCxxDAETzVNhJ63pO4gS3ahDtJMqToeY