 timeout 现象是否还存在。**\n\n如果 direct session 下明显改善，那就基本能说明：\n\n> **group session 是重要变量。**\n\n如果 direct session 下还是一样 timeout，那就说明：\n\n> **问题主要不在 group/direct，而在 `sessions_send` 的嵌套等待机制本身。**\n\n---\n\n## 我建议直接下一步\n我现在就可以做这个最小验证：\n\n- 目标改成  \n  `agent:weiwei:feishu:weiwei:direct:ou_a3f82c9b86b901da5819edf5baf966b6`\n- 发送同样的回传测试\n- 看它是不是还 timeout\n\n如果你同意，我下一条就直接测。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd0cccda648191adeb624aded58483\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":10029,"output":503,"cacheRead":73600,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84132,"cost":{"input":0.0250725,"output":0.0075450000000000005,"cacheRead":0.0184,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0510175}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773997253308}}
