tant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"**Considering retry options**\\n\\nI realize I need to inform the user that there might have been a timeout during the process, which could explain why I haven't received a response. It feels natural to mention this uncertainty because it’s important for clarity. I wonder if it makes sense to retry my request once more? I think I might need to make these kinds of decisions more often, but it’s all about making sure the user is kept in the loop!\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"我先回传给 main。刚才工具返回超时，我补发一次确认。\",\n          \"textSignature\": \"{\\\"v\\\":1,\\\"id\\\":\\\"msg_00be9fb098d6a51f0169bd0d7e2c048191ae471feab6925c89\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"toolCall\",\n          \"id\": \"call_VAeQfUeKr4n5SCysK82Uz5I5|fc_00be9fb098d6a51f0169bd0d7e3ac88191bb869ffab8ead640\",\n          \"name\": \"sessions_send\",\n          \"arguments\": {\n            \"sessionKey\": \"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\",\n            \"message\": \"状态：成功\\n任务：weiwei direct session 通信测试\\n结果：weiwei direct 已收到并可回传。\",\n            \"timeoutSeconds\": 20\n          },\n          \"partialJson\": \"{\\\"sessionKey\\\":\\\"agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8\\\",\\\"message\\\":\\\"状态：成功\\\\n任务：weiwei direct session 通信测试\\\\n结果：weiwei direct 已收到并可回传。\\\",\\\"timeoutSeconds\\\":20}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"openai-codex-responses\",\n      \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n      \"model\": \"gpt-5.4\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"toolUse\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1773997433289\n    }\n  ],\n  \"truncated\": false,\n  \"droppedMessages\": false,\n  \"contentTruncated\": false,\n  \"contentRedacted\": false,\n  \"bytes\": 2696\n}"}],"details":{"sessionKey":"agent:weiwei:feishu:weiwei:direct:ou_a3f82c9b86b901da5819ed