{"type":"message","id":"dc3f4ef5","parentId":"6e638444","timestamp":"2026-03-20T09:04:41.251Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 收到，这条回执把结论彻底坐实了。\n\n## 最终结论\n> **weiwei 的 direct session 也是通的。**\n> **所以 weiwei 配置没有问题。**\n\n而且现在已经确认：\n\n- **group session**：能收，能回\n- **direct session**：也能收，能回\n- 但 **`sessions_send` 仍然报 timeout**\n\n所以这事到这里已经很清楚：\n\n> **不是 weiwei 配置写错。**\n> **不是 group/direct 差异。**\n> **就是 `sessions_send` 在 agent↔agent 回传场景里的等待机制有问题。**\n\n一句话总结：\n\n> **通信是真的通，timeout 是工具层的同步等待问题。**\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接做两种之一：\n\n1. **继续扒源码，定位 `sessions_send` 的等待闭环**\n2. **给你整理一套稳定的多-agent 联调方案，后面不再被这个 timeout 误导**","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd0da4962081918eac9786c4cc396e\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":75415,"output":230,"cacheRead":10752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":86397,"cost":{"input":0.18853750000000002,"output":0.00345,"cacheRead":0.002688,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.19467550000000003}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773997472743}}
