{"type":"message","id":"44d6f1f9","parentId":"b5b9bfa1","timestamp":"2026-03-20T09:06:59.107Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Clarifying memory usage**\n\nI want the answer to be nuanced, but I’m unsure about whether I need memory for this situation. It seems like we’re discussing previous work, but it might not be necessary in this context. The instruction mentions using memory_search for past decisions, but maybe it’s just about current work. I should also clarify that it's not only weiwei who timed out; there were others too, which could help show it’s not just focusing on one individual.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd0e224c048191aae523e6eac83be0\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpvQ4mT5yN49JE1NvYN9Ewl7dKuzt1gxWwOAkJJ0J-XQzj0mJOeADKKH4LCq2u-Kcg6bt-U6KRBg_Ox_DYy8-BA9xmq-zCg1KKYDOvLfqDJobms2UOq4oa2gXEaiE8e_OcsieTaXWRqtO4YjWgfPv8JLqGJttKicvfonDRFWXn_mel5s1lwsMWbiAX9hqbSYzjFq4DGK5JoOZ4MmUxvowT2sEF5lLYPEDJUPV3bJhexwp-J5ooOxYb9i63We7i8NwwUOBfjpD9219CacBgnQHVDHzSXkavRqGowvry2JiKA0QrultE9fuvur340hKTKQStL4aIU5Yc9KJFoRymAh14H2uHBcixsQ3lQmyOIEZMZZ_ziiNt1V2dTMVbSCuA22EpU3ZKt0jXW4nh3bgJW6Qx0DIY5SFKpUQwOJhxUuH5LQwlBtvptuOnZ06SFeYx5Iedjk6TxNCo8ZRlrFszW1fu44PFJI38n30TF0Z4RVQZ7HuCnlY_ZJKAL9yzt9VHj4Rd32aI6UWgcU_CO3ONh_NnT1TTqHb_W9OQBrUPAnhGI0aIOKhd4OyjR6ZGH51dlxMF0gZKiMEoTeMtFXzvbpklWx-wq4_7Y7IvwX6gkWXYW-Rsb7DnaxhTVGkqlVWtn1UcBF2JL9PO4SPetM5bted-Hvd12V6YR_08LTAERdjx-2gB8xaJ5_WP3hnYTi9-UPj9L_Mg3g3vGSAkXAI3Oi0TIaFjXBsdAFoJCCb8WXAvNOAjFD-8deRaqJGv8Jlf_6YvjYe17fE_ZMX-aPACf7poN7e4_o5OHBxfhBBxaI_O2NpAIVuYmiQxJKWKYgpS6MtNE2y4a78HntE5gq69Ej0J2Lfac4X-rlp3Ni1iyKIqH3WdgMtIh7e92gIRSyMRJXBOHwvakrQAig1rKuf2xTvDNUnCzSET8bFrocizMrUjWLSKV0-rdMZq_JDs7vm8HwT47ngiC6jhKUnblVbtZLwT63pb81QxaUsdxasuhExs84i7zkg52ZktnoBOg_R4gn0wX1Gqku0T02RF7UiOQk2-LESHcvMN6HYMaN3ZjDoy-38MCfkxKbh2EFk4zomqn021LMJ9l8ikKhPmSiziobki3IpG7Q7FCldNYUVIqlZKOh-TtEODqRFNuECMdwtkz6Btgl4M6WQbi3a_v3bzIUKCOxaShaGE9_D10hS1f49-DwZGhAMXEmPuHMHkIzjtrQxC6G9cqVCp72Zo7aBCjvHFESG-GtJP4DvMq8-rD_3YSKBTZ2DaKsifbAtY0jB4ZUVeVrqV_vydTBNgDY-tgZY-r68TgQ==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Clarifying memory usage**\\n\\nI want the answer to be nuanced, but I’m unsure about whether I need memory for this situation. It seems like we’re discussing previous work, but it might not be necessary in this context. The instruction mentions using memory_search for past decisions, but maybe it’s just about current work. I should also clarify that it's not only weiwei who timed out; there were others too, which could help show it’s not just focusing on one individual.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 结论先说：\n\n> **不是单独 weiwei 有问题。**\n> **前面 xixi / ling / aoao 也都出现过同样的 timeout。**\n\n你会觉得“只有 weiwei 有问题”，主要是这几个原因叠加：\n\n## 1）weiwei 被测得最多\n前面为了排查，我们对 weiwei 做了更多轮：\n\n- 群会话测\n- direct 会话测\n- 单独重发\n- 60 秒预算验证\n\n所以它暴露出来的现象最多。  \n但最开始那轮里：\n\n- xixi：timeout\n- ling：timeout\n- aoao：timeout\n- weiwei：timeout\n\n**四个其实都中过。**\n\n---\n\n## 2）xixi / ling / aoao 回执来得更快，容易让人误以为“它们没问题”\n它们虽然也 timeout，但很快就把结果回给 main 了，于是体感像：\n\n- “它们只是偶发一下”\n- “weiwei 才是真的有问题”\n\n但本质不是这样。  \n本质是：\n\n> **别的 agent 超时后也成功回传了，只是 weiwei 被你盯着反复测，所以更显眼。**\n\n---\n\n## 3）weiwei 确实有一个“表象上更特殊”的地方：它同时有 group 和 direct 两种会话\n这会让人天然怀疑它：\n\n- 会不会 group 配错？\n- 会不会 direct 才正常？\n- 会不会 binding 异常？\n\n但我们已经实测过了：\n\n- weiwei **group** 能通\n- weiwei **direct** 也能通\n\n所以这个差异只是“看起来可疑”，不是根因。\n\n---\n\n## 4）weiwei 的角色更像“验证者”，更容易在失败时补发、重试、解释\n从它的实际会话看，它会在 timeout 后继续说类似：\n\n- “我先回传给 main”\n- “刚才工具返回超时，我补发一次确认”\n\n这会让你更容易注意到它的异常流程。  \n而别的 agent 有时更干脆，回完就结束了，存在感没那么强。\n\n---\n\n## 最准确的判断\n一句话：\n\n> **weiwei 不是“单独有问题”，而是“被重点测试，所以问题表现得更充分”。**\n\n真正的根因仍然是：\n\n> **`sessions_send` 在 agent ↔ agent 回传场景里，会等待一个比“消息送达”更晚的完成点。**\n> **所以消息明明送达了、回执也回来了，主侧仍然可能先看到 timeout。**\n\n---\n\n## 你现在可以怎么理解\n### 错误理解\n- “只有 weiwei 配置有问题”\n\n### 正确理解\n- **所有 agent 都可能触发这个 timeout**\n- **weiwei 只是被拿来做了更多对照实验**\n- **实验结果反而证明：weiwei 配置是正常的，问题在工具机制**\n\n---\n\n## 最后一句\n所以答案很直接：\n\n> **不是单独 weiwei 有问题。**\n> **是 weiwei 被拿来做了更彻底的排查，结果把同一个底层问题放大看清了。**\n\n如果你要，我下一步可以直接把这次排查整理成一份 **“最终诊断结论 + 建议处理方案”**，你后面就不用再来回解释这件事。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd0e268f148191b8e5c97db3a411d1\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":85455,"output":846,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":87837,"cost":{"input":0.2136375,"output":0.01269,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.2267115}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773997599592}}
