e dependency on PIL and possibly check if Pillow is installed. It could be a good idea to run an example since the user wants to see how it works. Maybe I could execute a sample to confirm everything is functioning as expected.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"我顺手跑一个最小示例，确认这玩意在你这台机器上能不能直接生成。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd12fbeee0819190fba42a3ab7071f\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ylZlWeUVStIqlCQ5dJqD3Lqd|fc_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd12fbf8e081919b854907cbd275bd","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/redbook-image-generator/scripts/generate_cover.py \"今日分享\" \"打卡第二天\" \"今天天气很好\\n心情也不错\\n继续加油！\" && ls -lh /root/.openclaw/workspace/xhs_cover.jpg","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":40},"partialJson":"{\"command\":\"python3 /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/redbook-image-generator/scripts/generate_cover.py \\\"今日分享\\\" \\\"打卡第二天\\\" \\\"今天天气很好\\\\n心情也不错\\\\n继续加油！\\\" && ls -lh /root/.openclaw/workspace/xhs_cover.jpg\",\"workdir\":\"/root/.openclaw/workspace\",\"yieldMs\":10000,\"timeout\":40}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1510,"output":180,"cacheRead":92800,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":94490,"cost":{"input":0.003775,"output":0.0027,"cacheRead":0.0232,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.029675}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773998830269}}
