{"type":"message","id":"77afb638","parentId":"68c4d536","timestamp":"2026-03-20T09:27:45.898Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Considering installation requirements**\n\nI need to mention that using Pillow requires installation, but it’s important to get confirmation before proceeding. Installing software usually needs explicit consent according to guidelines, so I shouldn't go ahead and install anything on my own. I can inform the user they'll need to run something like `pip install Pillow` themselves. That way, I’m respecting the rules while still providing the needed information!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd12fedbfc8191ae87383b10d5093c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpvRMB1g95Pz6Bh49y3KyPszfXcZHwsPQv5iT2rjFS6YLG68UX54ts4Ois00Z08Zyiwu-RMnbsZCiB68B8rZSrnnFLvk-lLirzgfrcjUDMz8kFRj8eT7ZC_mWkBjkHzitb3-02GJ0JMi23TpdXxDBerxaTlsq7vjWzcus_xUV4-5R-1s7NA200DyVt8T2jQq1uDh93ZTo9Rtanplg_tTXdvH_168b2bBYXhr_N4y2AUihfEpdOukWE7zWlMfmVt89WrTfYeCc2DjpaJdZWCQzcVchmOUMbIaS3KvwVUHCVEH435Ld6vSXwpe5T9J5omJWlRKNawwZJgH66A-C4IBpSJ-NtSxyuX0cXpwrMbKwEW6CoYFqwG_zblfCoYPALrttqNYtoyG7MJwGy9J81DIURE4iAxDGuPKeHM3mdD_vajxzIHfMV2f8OJh1rWXREFBeR-5biwjNENsX_W2BMbJP9gIHQSfQSR6EOYJ8-Xo1Q0Fh5p1FJc_xTuXwaIMr-VKA95jnS1aq12EjaMMnr8HtXtSolvC0MTt9aywvOddCW0VMOabkItEf0AwDnayU5Sbbi1YdhtG4mUfkg3irgVhngHRvieUM878so76Erx9mb9QUJVXSxNJAib3pMaqc2BrePxa0BFYQaTJbW3PmNYPBi4s4zxqm3qZU_sdPHeB6rHCNOBXPOd6vqjogvna3TcJfCW6SyZH9tdVbNMHuKfbCoIIbOG33LiPLxlYON6JceBlnf4ijWG99o4O4ofhOiIoZHc1uYTEwVlLeDrHOtm8x5o3XM1HbnZxCj2737jhAMUccbnCJm48Mq-lQjWrMzQgYT81phloYws6B2juL-6cRdAMzjZj39eAus0xKjsKzTI0xZPhrIUB8N1IVsWnNnD1ApT-H8qtt3lijHohJXeTLsAVi1AYVF8G9eqM5dZzrGijg2A5Nt9n_sm4Jzi0qHdBCfwWCSOA7umnAkRYfz3htKQhun42Zgz8y8Iw7PdlvDcVIx9gyJvUic8QB3EnxFuceTvIFvQJRVKoL5qnaCgiyIs86LZRBnKJ-12Yk5rMwqiBX7u5Y=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Considering installation requirements**\\n\\nI need to mention that using Pillow requires installation, but it’s important to get confirmation before proceeding. Installing software usually needs explicit consent according to guidelines, so I shouldn't go ahead and install anything on my own. I can inform the user they'll need to run something like `pip install Pillow` themselves. That way, I’m respecting the rules while still providing the needed information!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 可以，已经加上了，也看清楚它怎么用。\n\n## 结果\n技能已安装到：\n\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/redbook-image-generator`\n\n来源：\n\n- `clawhub`\n- slug: `redbook-image-generator`\n- owner: `binsonHao`\n- version: `1.0.0`\n\n## 它实际怎么用\n这个 skill 很简单，本质上就是一个 Python 脚本：\n\n- 脚本路径：\n  `/root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/redbook-image-generator/scripts/generate_cover.py`\n\n调用方式：\n\n```bash\npython3 /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/redbook-image-generator/scripts/generate_cover.py \"标题\" \"副标题\" \"内容第一行\\n内容第二行\\n内容第三行\"\n```\n\n例如：\n\n```bash\npython3 /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/redbook-image-generator/scripts/generate_cover.py \"今日分享\" \"打卡第二天\" \"今天天气很好\\n心情也不错\\n继续加油！\"\n```\n\n输出文件固定是：\n\n- `/root/.openclaw/workspace/xhs_cover.jpg`\n\n---\n\n## 它内部实际做了什么\n我看了源码，逻辑很直白：\n\n1. 用 `PIL` 新建一张 **1080x1440** 的暖白背景图\n2. 随机画一些小圆点装饰\n3. 用系统字体写：\n   - 标题\n   - 副标题\n   - 多行正文\n4. 底部固定加一个：\n   - `#今日分享`\n5. 保存成 `xhs_cover.jpg`\n\n也就是说：\n\n> **它不是 AI 出图。**\n> **它是把你给的文字排版到一张固定风格海报上。**\n\n所以这更像：\n\n- 文本海报生成器\n- 小红书风格封面模板脚本\n\n不是：\n- 文生图模型\n- 智能设计引擎\n- 自动配多张复杂插画\n\n---\n\n## 我帮你实测了一下\n我已经跑过一次示例，结果是：\n\n> **当前不能直接用。**\n\n报错：\n\n```text\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'PIL'\n```\n\n根因很简单：\n\n> 机器上还没装 Python 依赖 `Pillow`\n\n---\n\n## 现在它的使用门槛\n要让它跑起来，至少要先装这个依赖：\n\n```bash\npython3 -m pip install Pillow\n```\n\n但这个属于**安装软件/依赖**，按规则我不会直接替你装，得你明确点头。\n\n---\n\n## 我的判断\n这个 skill 的优点：\n\n- 轻\n- 简单\n- 一看就懂\n- 适合快速生成“文字型小红书封面”\n\n它的缺点也很明显：\n\n- 风格固定，比较初级\n- 只有单模板\n- 没有智能排版\n- 没有图片素材融合\n- 依赖 `Pillow`\n- 输出路径固定，灵活性一般\n\n一句话评价：\n\n> **能用，但比较简陋，像个 demo 版模板技能。**\n\n---\n\n## 你现在有两个选择\n\n### 1）先让它跑起来\n你确认后，我再帮你安装依赖并测试出图。\n\n### 2）我直接帮你升级这个 skill\n我可以把它改成更实用版本，比如：\n\n- 支持自定义输出文件名\n- 支持多种封面配色\n- 支持自动换行\n- 支持更像小红书的版式\n- 支持 emoji / 标签\n- 支持从文章正文自动截取摘要生成封面\n\n如果你要实用，我更建议走 **2**。  \n因为原版确实有点糙。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_04bf43c9028fc02e0169bd1301d73081918778efa01a559fe3\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":233,"output":879,"cacheRead":94336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":95448,"cost":{"input":0.0005825,"output":0.013185,"cacheRead":0.023583999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.037351499999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773998844621}}
