{"type":"message","id":"5525ebbd","parentId":"6b966ed3","timestamp":"2026-03-20T09:56:41.760Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"019d0aacf91418a72459d56af55b09e3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"xiaohongshu-cover-generator\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"生成小红书风格封面图的 skill\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"main\": \"handler.ts\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"tsx scripts/handler.ts\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"xiaohongshu\",\n    \"cover\",\n    \"generator\",\n    \"image\"\n  ],\n  \"author\": \"\",\n  \"license\": \"MIT\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"node-fetch\": \"^3.3.2\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@types/node\": \"^20.0.0\",\n    \"tsx\": \"^4.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"config\": {\n    \"apiKeyHelp\": \"请前往 https://api.canghe.ai/ 获取您的 API Key\"\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774000601747}}
{"type":"message","id":"edcbb7be","parentId":"5525ebbd","timestamp":"2026-03-20T09:57:00.924Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see this skill uses an external API from canghe.ai, and it requires an API key. The user didn't provide this key, so I should let the user know this skill requires an API key and they would need to provide it or obtain one.\n\nLet me notify the user about this.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 这是一个 **AI 配图生成器**，需要外部 API Key 才能跑。\n\n## 现状\n`xiaohongshu-cover-generator` 这个技能的用法是：\n\n```bash\ncd /root/.openclaw/workspace/skills/xiaohongshu-cover-generator\nnpx tsx scripts/handler.ts \"你的主题\" \"API_KEY\"\n```\n\n或者设置环境变量：\n\n```bash\nCANGHE_API_KEY=\"你的KEY\" npx tsx scripts/handler.ts \"你的主题\"\n```\n\n## 它依赖\n- API 来源：https://api.canghe.ai/\n- 需要有效的 API Key\n\n## 问题\n当前没有配置 `CANGHE_API_KEY`，所以跑不起来。\n\n---\n\n## 你有几个选择\n\n### 方案 A：你提供 API Key\n如果你已经有 canghe.ai 的 Key，告诉我，我立刻帮你配好并生成。\n\n### 方案 B：放弃这个，用升级后的 `redbook-image-generator`\n我刚升级的 `redbook-image-generator` 也能生成小红书风格配图，而且**不需要任何 API Key**，纯本地脚本。\n\n它已经可以满足：\n- 文字封面\n- 标题 + 要点\n- 多主题配色\n\n---\n\n你选 A 还是 B？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":696,"output":377,"cacheRead":118912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":119985,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774000601756}}
