{"type":"message","id":"0fef2ebf","parentId":"77c5bf0d","timestamp":"2026-03-20T10:14:19.908Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can't fetch that. Let me just give a practical answer - the current configured models don't include explicit vision models. I should let the user know what's available and what needs to be done.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n[[reply_to_current]] 我查了一下，当前 `arkcode` 配置里**没有显式配置视觉模型**。\n\n## 当前 arkcode 现有的模型（7个）\n| 模型 ID | 名称 |\n|---------|------|\n| `doubao-seed-2.0-code` | Doubao Seed 2.0 Code |\n| `ark-code-latest` | ARK Code Latest |\n| `doubao-seed-code` | Doubao Seed Code |\n| `glm-4.7` | GLM-4.7 |\n| `deepseek-v3.2` | DeepSeek V3.2 |\n| `kimi-k2-thinking` | Kimi K2 Thinking |\n| `kimi-k2.5` | Kimi K2.5 |\n\n这些是纯文本/推理模型，**不含视觉能力**。\n\n---\n\n## 如果要用视觉模型\n你需要在 `openclaw.json` 里补充 `vision` 类型的模型。\n\n常见的 arkcode 视觉模型（按以往经验）：\n\n- `doubao-seed-2.0-vision`\n- `doubao-vision-pro`\n- `glm-4v`\n\n---\n\n## 你可以做的事\n1. **确认你想用哪个视觉模型**\n2. **把模型 ID 告诉我**，我帮你配到 `openclaw.json`\n\n或者我可以帮你直接查 arkcode 官网最新的模型列表。你想要哪个？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":730,"output":362,"cacheRead":123520,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":124612,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774001648072}}
