{"type":"message","id":"c8e74fe1","parentId":"b60bc6ab","timestamp":"2026-03-20T10:30:30.771Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants to use the Doubao Seedream 5.0 model to generate 2 images based on today's Apple article精华 (highlights). They want 3:4 aspect ratio (vertical), which is the standard Xiaohongshu ratio.\n\nI need to:\n1. First add the Doubao seedream-5-0 model to openclaw.json\n2. Use the model to generate 2 images - I'll need to use curl to call the API directly with the model\n\nLet me generate 2 different images based on the Apple article:\n- Image 1: The main alert about iPhone security threat\n- Image 2: The solution/fix (upgrade iOS)\n\nThe model is image generation (text-to-image), not vision (image understanding).\n\nLet me prepare the API call.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d0acbe8798f463c66d016851e9d79","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f:\n    data = json.load(f)\n\n# 添加 seedream 5.0 到模型列表\nseedream_model = {\n    \"id\": \"doubao-seedream-5-0-260128\",\n    \"name\": \"Doubao Seedream 5.0\"\n}\nif seedream_model not in data['models']['providers']['doubao'].get('models', []):\n    data['models']['providers']['doubao']['models'].append(seedream_model)\n\nwith open('/root/.openclaw/openclaw.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, indent=2)\nprint(\"✅ 模型已添加\")\nPY","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":1071,"output":544,"cacheRead":126720,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":128335,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774002608215}}
