{"type":"message","id":"c73ba1da","parentId":"7d86b347","timestamp":"2026-03-20T10:30:46.118Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let's generate two images - first the main alert, then the solution. I'll call the Doubao Seedream API directly. The model's base URL is `https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/compatible` and the API key is `fa7741c9-d143-47c9-a86a-f0811800e8b8`.\n\nThe aspect ratio 3:4 means 768x1024 or similar. Standard formats are usually in powers of 64. 3:4 ratio with 1024 height would be ~768x1024. Let me use 768x1024.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d0acc15af90ad42c9ce5b88e71e5f","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/compatible/v1/images/generations\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer fa7741c9-d143-47c9-a86a-f0811800e8b8\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"model\": \"doubao-seedream-5-0-260128\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Xiaohongshu social media cover image, urgent alert style. Title: 苹果紧急警告！4.2万台iPhone被入侵. Red warning badge, smartphone icon, dark hacker matrix style background, cybersecurity theme, red and black color scheme, 3:4 vertical ratio, clean modern design, Chinese text overlay\",\n    \"size\": \"768x1024\",\n    \"n\": 1\n  }' | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json, os, subprocess, time\nd = json.load(sys.stdin)\nif 'data' in d and d['data']:\n    url = d['data'][0].get('url','')\n    if url:\n        # 下载图片\n        subprocess.run(['curl', '-s', '-o', '/root/.openclaw/workspace/apple_alert.png', url])\n        print('✅ 图片1已生成: apple_alert.png')\n    else:\n        print('❌ 无返回URL:', d)\nelse:\n    print('❌ 错误:', d)\n\"","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":449,"output":622,"cacheRead":127744,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":1288