{"type":"message","id":"55dc01d2","parentId":"3f22d2b2","timestamp":"2026-03-20T12:27:57.525Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"有进展了！返回 400 但说明 endpoint 是通的，只是 size 参数需要更大。错误说 \"image size must be at least 3686400 pixels\"。\n\n让我计算一下 3:4 比例下需要多大：\n- 768x1024 = 786,432 像素\n- 需要的最小是 3,686,400 像素\n\n所以需要更大的尺寸。比如：\n- 1200x1600 = 1,920,000 - 还是不够\n- 1920x2560 = 4,915,200 - 够\n\n让我试试 1920x2560。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"019d0b37653789b15691f45c5b829fc9","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport requests, subprocess, os\n\nurl = \"https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3/images/generations\"\nheaders = {\n    \"Authorization\": \"Bearer fa7741c9-d143-47c9-a86a-f0811800e8b8\",\n    \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"\n}\npayload = {\n    \"model\": \"doubao-seedream-4-5-251128\",\n    \"prompt\": \"Xiaohongshu social media cover, urgent iPhone security warning, 4.2万台iPhone被入侵, red warning colors, smartphone, cybersecurity theme, dark hacker matrix background, 3:4 vertical ratio, modern clean design\",\n    \"size\": \"1920x2560\",\n    \"n\": 1\n}\n\ntry:\n    resp = requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=payload, timeout=120)\n    print(f\"Status: {resp.status_code}\")\n    d = resp.json()\n    if 'data' in d and d['data']:\n        img_url = d['data'][0].get('url','')\n        if img_url:\n            subprocess.run(['curl','-s','-o','/root/.openclaw/workspace/apple_seedream1.png',img_url])\n            print(\"✅ 图片1已保存: apple_seedream1.png\")\n        else:\n            print(\"No URL:\", d)\n    else:\n        print(\"Response:\", d)\nexcept Exception as e:\n    print(f\"Error: {e}\")\nPY","workdir":"/root/.openclaw/workspace","yieldMs":10000,"timeout":180}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"siliconflow","model":"Pro/MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":402,"output":634,"cacheRead":135168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13620